<title>CANADA: CanOxy working on Louisiana acquisition.</title>
<headline>CanOxy working on Louisiana acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Occidental Petroleum Ltd's chief financial officer Victor Zaleschuk said the company hoped to sign a deal in the next couple of weeks to acquire a property in the Gulf of Mexico, offshore Lousianna, from an unidentified company.</p>
<p>Zaleschuk said the cost of the acquisition would be in the range of US$50 million and said no further details could be given because CanOxy had not yet signed a letter of intent.</p>
<p>Zaleschuk was bullish about CanOxy's future.</p>
</text>
